pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# AC-2..AC-4: the achievements screen (tabs, sort, track), an unlock
# notification and the tracked achievement's free-roam chip. Host UI is not
# in captures; check the hostui and achievements events, or grab the screen.
# Run with --game-argument=--pad_remap=B=A: B presses advance the title menus.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 2000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 2000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 2000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 2000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1200 free-roam
xamdialog 1300 toast
hostkey 1700 f7
hostkey 1800 t
hostkey 1900 e
hostkey 2000 r
hostkey 2100 q
hostkey 2200 escape
input 2350 0010 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2356 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2700 tracked
hostkey 3000 f7
hostkey 3100 t
hostkey 3200 escape
stop 3300
